(7361934, 1152378, 83149, '<td valign="top">Great idea, one of the best in the whole challenge.  <br/>There are a couple of details that take away from the image though.  The shadows from the speakers is a small one, but the wrinkles in the background should have been removed in post. Bigger speakers would have also matched the image better.</td>', 'Great idea, one of the best in the whole challenge.  There are a couple of details that take away from the image though.  The shadows from the speakers is a small one, but the wrinkles in the background should have been removed in post. Bigger speakers would have also matched the image better.', '2015-06-13 19:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
