(7365478, 1152519, 68256, '<td valign="top">Juanice, I liked this during voting...a few things that would have increased my vote would have been to include something for the radio to rest on - it has an unbalanced floating feeling that is strange and the crop is awkward - an equal crop (that isn''t so tight) on both sides of the radio may have helped.  Also the buttons were a little too bright and distracting.  I loved the concept and overall execution but those few things brought my score down to a 6.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Juanice, I liked this during voting...a few things that would have increased my vote would have been to include something for the radio to rest on - it has an unbalanced floating feeling that is strange and the crop is awkward - an equal crop (that isn''t so tight) on both sides of the radio may have helped.  Also the buttons were a little too bright and distracting.  I loved the concept and overall execution but those few things brought my score down to a 6. ', '2015-06-17 09:34:18.000000', NULL, 0),
