(7366036, 1152264, 83149, '<td valign="top">This was very well done, one of the best of the lot of screaming children in the challenge.  It seemed to be a popular theme, I guess a lot of us parents got had a quick association between loud and kids  8-)<br/> <br/>On a technical note, I would have rather seen her left hand and hair in focus, I think the DOF was just a little too shallow.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the Red!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-06-17 19:56:24.</i></td>', 'This was very well done, one of the best of the lot of screaming children in the challenge.  It seemed to be a popular theme, I guess a lot of us parents got had a quick association between loud and kids  8-) On a technical note, I would have rather seen her left hand and hair in focus, I think the DOF was just a little too shallow. Congrats on the Red!', '2015-06-17 20:54:43.000000', '2015-06-17 20:56:24.000000', 0),
