(7366118, 1152264, 51793, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by FromDaRock:</b></div><hr/><i> This was very well done, one of the best of the lot of screaming children in the challenge.  It seemed to be a popular theme, I guess a lot of us parents got had a quick association between loud and kids  8-)<br/> <br/>On a technical note, I would have rather seen her left hand and hair in focus, I think the DOF was just a little too shallow.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the Red! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s the 50mm stopped down to 1.8... It''s a super sharp lens and I love it for that reason alone... Thanks everyone for the comments I really appreciate them. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-06-17 23:17:03.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by FromDaRock: This was very well done, one of the best of the lot of screaming children in the challenge.  It seemed to be a popular theme, I guess a lot of us parents got had a quick association between loud and kids  8-) On a technical note, I would have rather seen her left hand and hair in focus, I think the DOF was just a little too shallow. Congrats on the Red!   That''s the 50mm stopped down to 1.8... It''s a super sharp lens and I love it for that reason alone... Thanks everyone for the comments I really appreciate them. :)', '2015-06-18 00:16:50.000000', '2015-06-18 00:17:03.000000', 0),
