(7366209, 1152022, 137576, '<td valign="top">Being a builder, when has a soft metal nail ever sparked from being hit with a hammer?<br/> <br/>Unless you''ve hit a power line and its arc''ing through you haha<br/> <br/>Then it would make a loud bang, nothing quite like cutting through high voltage cables with an excavator to give you the shock of your life when they go boom.</td>', 'Being a builder, when has a soft metal nail ever sparked from being hit with a hammer? Unless you''ve hit a power line and its arc''ing through you haha Then it would make a loud bang, nothing quite like cutting through high voltage cables with an excavator to give you the shock of your life when they go boom.', '2015-06-18 03:36:41.000000', NULL, 0),
