(7369799, 1152022, 3936, '<td valign="top">True, a nail does not spark like that.  However, this is an excellent shot, and thank you so much for explaining how it was done.  A very refreshing change from the all too common N/A in the photographer''s comments.</td>', 'True, a nail does not spark like that.  However, this is an excellent shot, and thank you so much for explaining how it was done.  A very refreshing change from the all too common N/A in the photographer''s comments.', '2015-06-22 18:12:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7370327, 1152442, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>wow stunning image. The DOF is awesome. You have been able to bring out every detail in the feathers. I can almost hear his piercing screech. The lighting is a bit harsh on his bill, however. That really is my only negative. Overall good shot...I do think it should have scored slightly higher though.<br/> <br/>Happy shooting</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... wow stunning image. The DOF is awesome. You have been able to bring out every detail in the feathers. I can almost hear his piercing screech. The lighting is a bit harsh on his bill, however. That really is my only negative. Overall good shot...I do think it should have scored slightly higher though. Happy shooting', '2015-06-23 11:25:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7373766, 1152414, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>I definitely like the subject matter. I this was a great idea for "LOUD" everything about it screams loud. The biggest problem that I see is the background. There''s little distinction between his shirt and the background and also the guitar and the background. I think that had a very negative impact on your score. This might have been avoided by using a different light setup or even a slightly lighter backdrop. (not white) I don''t think white would have worked here either. There also seems to be some blur. That can sometimes be caused by a lighting issue or ISO. Good composition and good idea though. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... I definitely like the subject matter. I this was a great idea for "LOUD" everything about it screams loud. The biggest problem that I see is the background. There''s little distinction between his shirt and the background and also the guitar and the background. I think that had a very negative impact on your score. This might have been avoided by using a different light setup or even a slightly lighter backdrop. (not white) I don''t think white would have worked here either. There also seems to be some blur. That can sometimes be caused by a lighting issue or ISO. Good composition and good idea though. Happy shooting.', '2015-06-26 17:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7418916, 1152526, 100831, '<td valign="top">Why didn''t this score better? This just pops. Love it. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-11-29 12:32:34.</i></td>', 'Why didn''t this score better? This just pops. Love it. ', '2015-11-27 08:16:55.000000', '2015-11-29 12:32:34.000000', 0);
